# What a CLI deploy leaves out. Git deploys skip these anyway; the CLI uploads the whole folder,
# including agent worktrees and test output, and fails above 15,000 files.
# Every entry starts with a slash: without it a name matches at any depth, and "supabase" would
# take src/lib/supabase with it.
/.git
/.claude
/.impeccable
/.next
/.next-e2e
/node_modules
/e2e
/tests
/docs
/supabase
/test-results
/playwright-report
/blob-report
/coverage
*.log
